      "text": "This script parses the first \"Average Value Weighted Returns -- Monthly\" block from each file, computes each 2x3 SMB as the small-portfolio mean minus the big-portfolio mean, and averages the three. It keeps only months present in all three files and writes `output.csv`.\n\n```python\nimport re\nimport numpy as np\nimport pandas as pd\n\nFILES = [\n    \"6_Portfolios_2x3.csv\",\n    \"6_Portfolios_ME_OP_2x3.csv\",\n    \"6_Portfolios_ME_INV_2x3.csv\",\n]\nMARKER = \"Average Value Weighted Returns -- Monthly\"\n\n\ndef read_vw_monthly(path):\n    with open(path, encoding=\"latin-1\") as f:\n        lines = f.read().splitlines()\n\n    start = None\n    for i, line in enumerate(lines):\n        if MARKER.lower() in line.lower():\n            start = i\n            break\n    if start is None:\n        raise ValueError(f\"Marker not found in {path}\")\n\n    j = start + 1\n    while j < len(lines) and lines[j].strip() == \"\":\n        j += 1\n    header = [h.strip() for h in lines[j].split(\",\")]\n    cols = header[1:]\n    j += 1\n\n    rows = []\n    while j < len(lines):\n        parts = [p.strip() for p in lines[j].split(\",\")]\n        if parts and re.fullmatch(r\"\\d{6}\", parts[0]):\n            vals = []\n            for p in parts[1:1 + len(cols)]:\n                try:\n                    v = float(p)\n                except ValueError:\n                    v = np.nan\n                if v <= -99:  # -99.99 / -999 missing codes\n                    v = np.nan\n                vals.append(v)\n            while len(vals) < len(cols):\n                vals.append(np.nan)\n            rows.append([int(parts[0])] + vals)\n        else:\n            if rows:\n                break  # end of the first block\n        j += 1\n\n    df = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=[\"date\"] + cols)\n    df[\"date\"] = df[\"date\"].astype(int)\n    df = df.set_index(\"date\")\n\n    # Identify small / big portfolios by name; fall back to position\n    small = [c for c in cols if c.upper().startswith(\"SMALL\") or c.upper().startswith(\"ME1\")]\n    big = [c for c in cols if c.upper().startswith(\"BIG\") or c.upper().startswith(\"ME2\")]\n    if len(small) != 3 or len(big) != 3:\n        small = cols[:3]\n        big = cols[3:6]\n\n    smb = df[small].mean(axis=1) - df[big].mean(axis=1)\n    return smb.rename(\"smb\")\n\n\nseries = [read_vw_monthly(f) for f in FILES]\n\ncombined = pd.concat(series, axis=1, join=\"inner\").dropna()\ncombined = combined.sort_index()\n\nsmb = combined.mean(axis=1)\n\nout = pd.DataFrame({\n    \"date\": combined.index.astype(int),\n    \"value\": smb.values,\n})\nout.to_csv(\"output.csv\", index=False)\n```",
      "type": "text"
    }
